sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Wayland Client
    participant WL as wl_surface / linux-dmabuf
    participant SM as SurfaceManager
    participant IMP as DmabufImporter
    participant VK as Vulkan Device
    participant SG as SceneGraph

    Client->>WL: zwp_linux_buffer_params_v1.create_immed
    Note over Client,WL: fd + stride + modifier per plane
    Client->>WL: wl_surface.attach(buffer) + damage + commit
    WL->>SM: SurfaceCommit(buffer, syncobj)
    SM->>SM: extract DmabufDesc from wl_buffer
    SM->>IMP: canImport(desc)
    IMP->>VK: vkGetPhysicalDeviceFormatProperties2 (modifier check)
    IMP-->>SM: true
    SM->>IMP: import(desc)
    IMP->>VK: VkImportMemoryFdInfoKHR + vkCreateImage
    IMP->>VK: vkAcquireSyncObject (drm-syncobj timeline)
    IMP-->>SM: ImportedImage
    SM->>SG: SurfaceNode.attach(image) + markDirty
    SG->>VK: composite pass (sample client buffer)
    VK->>VK: present to KMS framebuffer

    Note over Client,VK: On release: wait semaphore → release fd → wl_buffer.release
